# HR Contract Generation & Export

Generate 3 types of printable HR contracts (HĐLĐ, HĐTV, Cam kết bảo mật) from employee data already stored in the HR module, ready for employees to sign.

## Proposed Changes

### Database – Add missing employee fields

The contract templates require `current_address` (chỗ ở hiện tại) and `id_issue_date/id_issue_place` which exist in [HrEmployee](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/types.ts#291-343) type but may be empty. No schema change needed – these fields already exist in the table. HR just needs to fill them.

---

### Contract Service

#### [NEW] [contractService.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/services/contractService.ts)

Creates the contract generation logic using `jspdf` (already installed in [package.json](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/package.json)).

**Approach:** Build each contract as structured HTML rendered in an invisible iframe, then use the browser's `window.print()` to produce a clean PDF. This avoids jsPDF's poor Vietnamese font support.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Using **HTML + `window.print()`** instead of jsPDF's text API because:
> - Vietnamese characters (dấu) render perfectly with system fonts
> - CSS `@page` rules give precise A4 layout control
> - Tables, margins, signatures all work natively
> - jsPDF requires embedding custom fonts (~500KB+) and still struggles with complex diacritics

Each contract function receives [HrEmployee](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/types.ts#291-343), [HrDepartment](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/types.ts#281-290), and `HrEmployeeSalary[]` as inputs and returns an HTML string.

**3 functions:**
- `generateHDLD(employee, department, salaryComponents)` → HĐLĐ (Labour Contract, 5 pages)
- `generateHDTV(employee, department, salaryComponents)` → HĐTV (Probation Contract, 4 pages)
- `generateNDA(employee, department)` → Cam kết bảo mật (Confidentiality Agreement, 3 pages)

**Data mapping from HR:**

| Contract Field | Source |
|---|---|
| Họ và tên | `employee.full_name` |
| Ngày sinh | `employee.date_of_birth` |
| Giới tính | `employee.gender` |
| Quốc tịch | `employee.nationality` |
| CMND/CCCD | `employee.id_number` |
| Ngày cấp | `employee.id_issue_date` |
| Nơi cấp | `employee.id_issue_place` |
| Hộ khẩu / Địa chỉ | `employee.address` |
| Bộ phận | `department.name` |
| Chức danh | `employee.position` |
| Ngày bắt đầu | `employee.start_date` |
| Hết thử việc | `employee.probation_end` |
| Lương cơ bản | salary component `base_salary` |
| Phụ cấp ăn trưa | salary component `lunch` |
| Phụ cấp xăng xe, ĐT | salary component `transport` |
| Phụ cấp trang phục | salary component `clothing` |
| Phụ cấp KPI | salary component `kpi` |

**Fixed data (Company info):**
- Công ty: CÔNG TY TNHH TD GAMES
- Đại diện: Đặng Thế Toàn – Giám đốc
- Giờ làm: 8:30 – 17:30
- Ngày trả lương: Ngày 3~5 hàng tháng

---

### UI Component

#### [NEW] [ContractGenerator.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/components/ContractGenerator.tsx)

A modal/drawer triggered from [EmployeeDetail](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/components/EmployeeDetail.tsx#17-372) with:
1. **Contract type selector**: 3 cards (HĐLĐ, HĐTV, NDA) with icons
2. **Contract metadata form**: Signing date, contract number prefix
3. **Preview area**: Rendered HTML preview of the contract in an iframe
4. **Action buttons**: "🖨️ In / Xuất PDF" (triggers `window.print()` on the iframe)

Design follows the existing dark theme with `bg-surface`, `border-primary/10`, glassmorphism cards.

---

### Integration

#### [MODIFY] [EmployeeDetail.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/components/EmployeeDetail.tsx)

- Add a "📝 Xuất hợp đồng" button in the header alongside "✏️ Sửa"
