## Verification Plan

### Manual Testing (Browser)
1. Run `npm run dev` → open `http://localhost:3000`
2. Navigate to HR → click on a fulltime employee (Đặng Thế Toàn)
3. Click "📝 Xuất hợp đồng" button
4. Select each of the 3 contract types and verify:
   - Employee data is filled correctly 
   - Salary and allowances match the DB values
   - Vietnamese text renders without issues  
   - "In / Xuất PDF" opens the browser print dialog with correct A4 layout
5. Confirm print preview shows proper page breaks and formatting
